# Menace (CR 702.110b): Bot2's lone Ornithopter cannot block Harvester of Misery (the refusal) but can block Bot1's Ornithopter
# attacking beside it (the positive control, the same blocker on another attacker). Harvester was cast first so its enters
# trigger shrank nothing of Bot1's own.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Swamp
Harvester of Misery
Ornithopter
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Harvester of Misery.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Harvester of Misery; Ornithopter > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Harvester of Misery)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Ornithopter)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
